short_desc "IRS"
long_desc "This is the long awaited Bailiff's office of Nannymud. Here money, generouslyand enthusiasticly given by the inhabitants of Nannymud is stored and used inwell needed charity-work, like well... like paying the Bailiff and his guards.There is a list here."
